usage: writ <command> [args]

commands:
  check <policy.json> [...]      check a policy for errors and warnings, and changed tools
  expand <policy.json> [--out f] print a layer-2 policy as the layer-1 policy it expands to
  digest <policy.json>           print the policy digest
  import mcp <tools.json> [...]  draft a layer-2 policy from an MCP tool list
  replay <traces.jsonl>...       replay traces against their expectations
  oracle <policy.json> [...]     step the kernel over events read from stdin
  explain <traces.jsonl> [...]   describe each step of a trace
  diff <old> <new> <jsonl> [...] replay events under two policies and list changed verdicts
  traces <policy.json> [...]     emit the shortest trace for every abstract transition

options:
  --help      show this help (also: writ <command> --help)
  --version   show the version
